+- `evidence/producer-and-target-check.txt`: raw producer hashes, manifests,
+  generated file list, target scan, and candidate absence; and
+- `evidence/tool-versions.txt`: K 7.1.293 and Lean 4.22.0 tool identities.
+
+VERDICT: PASS
+LEGITIMACY: LEGIT
